---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="How It Works | Panhandle Headlight Restoration"
  description="Our seven-step mobile headlight restoration process. Wet sand, polish, and coat with a professional UV-rated hard coat, backed by a 6, 18, or 36-month written guarantee."
>
  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our process</span>
      <h2>Seven steps from hazy to clear.</h2>
      <p>Every job follows the same process. No shortcuts, no skipped sealing step, no surprises. Typical time on-site: 60 to 90 minutes per vehicle.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="proc-list">
      <li>
        <span class="proc-num">1</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Inspection & on-site quote</h3>
          <p>We arrive at your driveway, workplace, or lot. We inspect both headlights, note any damage or heavy oxidation, and confirm the tier that fits your situation. Any add-on charge (heavy oxidation, larger housings, damage repair) gets quoted before we start. If the number doesn&rsquo;t work for you, we walk away, no charge.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="proc-num">2</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Mask & protect</h3>
          <p>Painted surfaces, chrome trim, headlight seals, and any adjacent plastic get masked off with automotive-grade tape. This keeps the sanding process from touching anything it shouldn&rsquo;t.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="proc-num">3</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Progressive wet sanding</h3>
          <p>We work through a full grit progression, typically 400, 800, 1500, 2000, and 3000. Each pass removes finer scratches from the previous one. Skipping grits (a common shortcut) leaves haze that no coating can hide. We don&rsquo;t skip.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="proc-num">4</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Machine polish</h3>
          <p>After the final sanding pass, we polish the lens to optical clarity with a dual-action polisher and a cutting compound. This is where the lens goes from cloudy-but-smooth to fully clear.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="proc-num">5</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Surface prep</h3>
          <p>The lens gets cleaned with an alcohol-based prep solution and dried completely. Any dust, polish residue, or oil left on the surface would prevent the coating from bonding. This step is short but non-negotiable.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="proc-num">6</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Coating applied</h3>
          <p>We apply the coating for your chosen tier:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Clear Coat</strong> &mdash; 3M Professional Clear Coat wipe (6-month guarantee)</li>
            <li><strong>Clear Coat Pro</strong> &mdash; Delta Kits Infinity liquid coating with UV stabilizers (18-month guarantee)</li>
            <li><strong>Clear Coat UV</strong> &mdash; GlasWeld COAT UV-cured hard coat, cured with a UV lamp so it bonds hard to the polycarbonate lens (36-month guarantee)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="proc-num">7</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Cure & hand off</h3>
          <p>The coating cures in place (UV-lamp cure for the UV tier, air cure for the others). We do a final inspection with you, walk you through the coverage details in writing, and your guarantee window starts that day. If anything is not right, we redo it.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="card" style="text-align:center;padding:2rem 1.5rem;max-width:640px;margin:3rem auto 0;">
      <h3 style="font-size:var(--h3);margin-bottom:.6rem;">Ready to book?</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1.4rem;">Text a photo of your headlights for a free quote. We reply same day, usually within an hour.</p>
      <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:center;">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="sms:+18505836322?&body=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20headlight%20quote.">Text (850) 583-6322</a>
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="tel:+18505836322">Call (850) 583-6322</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .proc-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }
  .proc-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
    background: var(--paper-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    align-items: start;
    transition: transform .25s var(--ease), box-shadow .25s var(--ease);
  }
  .proc-list li:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  }
  .proc-num {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 13px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--beam), var(--beam-strong));
    color: #241a00;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .proc-list h3 { font-size: var(--h3); margin: 0 0 .5rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .proc-list p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 .5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .proc-list ul { margin: .5rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .proc-list ul li {
    display: list-item;
    padding: 0;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    margin: .35rem 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .proc-list ul li:hover { transform: none; box-shadow: none; }
  .proc-list strong { color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .proc-list li { grid-template-columns: 46px 1fr; padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem; gap: 1rem; }
    .proc-num { width: 44px; height: 44px; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  }
</style>
